# Candidate theme palettes, loaded by main.tsx in dev only. Scaffolding for
# choosing a direction -- it pulls in webfonts none of the shipping theme
# uses, and the winning palette gets promoted into theme.css by hand. The
# import tolerates its absence, so a clone without it builds and tests fine.
